WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
<v DANA>Say someone new is standing at their desk tomorrow with a used needle.

2
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:05.680
<v DANA>Where does your mind go?

3
00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.560
<v RAY>Where the nearest sharps container is.

4
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.840
<v RAY>If you were holding a used needle right now...

5
00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:14.080
<v RAY>how FAR would you have to walk to get there?
